[00:11.300]The clock stopped ticking, forever ago.
{"时钟在很久前就已停摆"}
[00:15.300]How long have I been up? I don't know.
{"我清醒多久了？我不知道"}
[00:18.300]I can't get a grip, But I can't let go
{"我无法掌控 却又无法放手"}
[00:22.300]There wasn't anything to hold on to though
{"尽管根本没有什么可抓牢"}
[00:25.300]Why can't I see?
{"为何我看不见？"}
[00:27.300]Why can't I see?
{"为何我看不见？"}
[00:29.300]All the colors that you see
