{"求求你 能否让我"}
[00:34.300]Please, Can I be
{"求求你 能否让我"}
[00:36.300]Colorful and free?
{"也绚丽而自由？"}
[00:39.300]WHAT THE HELL'S GOING ON?!
{"这到底怎么回事？！"}
[00:40.300]CAN SOMEONE TELL ME PLEASE
{"谁能告诉我原因"}
[00:42.300]WHY, I'M SWITCHING FASTER
{"为何 我切换的速度"}
[00:44.300]THAN THE CHANNELS ON TV!!
{"比电视频道还快！！"}
[00:45.300]I'M black, THEN I'M white!!
{"我忽而漆黑 忽而苍白！！"}
[00:47.300]NO!SOMETHING ISN'T RIGHT!!
{"不！这绝对不对劲！！"}
[00:49.300]MY ENEMY'S INVISIBLE
{"我的敌人无形无踪"}
[00:50.300]I DON'T KNOW HOW TO FIGHT
{"我不知该如何抗争"}
[00:52.300]THE TREMBLING FEAR
{"这战栗的恐惧"}
[00:54.300]IS MORE THAN I CAN TAKE
{"已超出我的承受"}
[00:56.300]WHEN I'M UP AGAINST
{"当我面对的"}
[00:58.300]THE ECHO IN THE MIRROR!!
{"是镜中的回声！！"}
[00:59.300]ECHO--
[01:07.300]why, why something, why something isn't right
{"为什么 为什么有些 为什么有些不对劲"}
[01:17.300]I don't know,I don't know how to find
{"我不知道 我不知道如何找寻"}
[01:27.300]It's time to let go
{"是时候放手了"}
[01:28.300]Burn it down to the ground and to break all the silence
{"将一切焚毁殆尽 打破所有沉默"}
[01:32.300]See what I become now
{"看看我如今的模样"}
[01:35.300]When I cut the tail from the past
{"当我斩断过往的牵绊"}
[01:36.300]look round the world and that’s what I’ve got
{"环顾世界 这就是我拥有的一切"}
[01:37.300]broken screen, flashing around
{"破碎的屏幕 在四周闪烁"}
[01:39.300]It’s not the end of the game,
{"这并非游戏的终点"}
[01:40.300]it’s not
{"不是"}
[01:41.300]But now I caught in the riddle
{"但此刻我困在谜题之中"}
[01:43.300]Once you looking in side never know how to look back
{"一旦窥见深渊 便不知如何回头"}
[01:44.300]Then I heard the echo laugh
{"随后我听见回声在嘲笑"}
[01:46.300]SO, I burn it all down on the ground
{"所以 我将一切付之一炬"}
[01:49.300]Make it all dead before I hear a sound
{"在听见声响前彻底毁灭"}
[01:51.300]Everything is quiet I look into the mirror
{"万籁俱寂 我凝视镜中"}
[01:53.300]And see the beast that’s what I’ve become
{"看见野兽 那已成为我的模样"}
[01:54.300]It’s not the way I want it.
{"这不是我想要的结局"}
[01:56.300]But I standing in a mess that I made
{"却站在自己制造的混乱里"}
[01:58.300]Then I cried
{"于是我哭泣"}
[01:59.300]The echo in the mirror still laughing at me .
{"镜中的回声仍在嘲笑我"}
